{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Pony Factory",
    "steam_appid": 2536530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536530/extras/e89342a317de0ba3c9f1dcdbdd026b32.avif?t=1750084045\" /></span><br><br>Winston arrived at a solution to the moral decay of his town.  <br><br>He called out to hell, and hell answered.  The human body could, hell promised, be twisted and stretched into a kinder, more equine shape.  Winston's town, now filled with ignorant hate-mongers, could instead be filled with magical ponies, if he could provide a factory in which to make them.  Winston thought they would be beautiful, gentle, and good.  <br><br><i><strong>Hell had other plans...</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536530/extras/29a3c6b065fdb2edcd9d91c5546ae234.avif?t=1750084045\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meaty FPS combat against highly agile foes who will attempt to evade and flank you.<br></li><li>Darkness is your enemy!  Use muzzle flashes, sparks, sound, and other clues to track foes during combat.<br></li><li>High contrast black and white aesthetic inspired by early 1950's science fiction films.<br></li><li>A short minimalist campaign that can be completed in about 30 minutes.<br></li><li>Numerous improvements from the original release, including many new quality of life features, balance and game feel improvements, new story and gameplay content, full gamepad support, and of course bugfixes!</li></ul><br>Originally made in 7 days for <u>The Dread X Collection</u> as an exercise in doing a lot with a little, The Pony Factory is a horror FPS inspired by Doom 3, with a striking aesthetic and dark sense of humor.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536530/extras/e89342a317de0ba3c9f1dcdbdd026b32.avif?t=1750084045\" /></span><br><br>Winston arrived at a solution to the moral decay of his town.  <br><br>He called out to hell, and hell answered.  The human body could, hell promised, be twisted and stretched into a kinder, more equine shape.  Winston's town, now filled with ignorant hate-mongers, could instead be filled with magical ponies, if he could provide a factory in which to make them.  Winston thought they would be beautiful, gentle, and good.  <br><br><i><strong>Hell had other plans...</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536530/extras/29a3c6b065fdb2edcd9d91c5546ae234.avif?t=1750084045\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meaty FPS combat against highly agile foes who will attempt to evade and flank you.<br></li><li>Darkness is your enemy!  Use muzzle flashes, sparks, sound, and other clues to track foes during combat.<br></li><li>High contrast black and white aesthetic inspired by early 1950's science fiction films.<br></li><li>A short minimalist campaign that can be completed in about 30 minutes.<br></li><li>Numerous improvements from the original release, including many new quality of life features, balance and game feel improvements, new story and gameplay content, full gamepad support, and of course bugfixes!</li></ul><br>Originally made in 7 days for <u>The Dread X Collection</u> as an exercise in doing a lot with a little, The Pony Factory is a horror FPS inspired by Doom 3, with a striking aesthetic and dark sense of humor.",
    "short_description": "Winston thought he could use heavy machinery and power from the depths of hell to transform sinful men into magic ponies. Winston was wrong.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
